  "details": "I'm aware SDK2 is no longer supported, but I wanted to bring this up as it breaks so many great worlds and seems like it may be a straightforward fix.\n\nIn SDK2 worlds, OnPlayerTriggerEnter is no longer working for players when entering a trigger collider. This breaks core functionality in many worlds.\n\nA good example is this classic, \"Fever Dream\": https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4137b868-771b-4dd1-ac76-a138d56dbd41/\n\nSteps to reproduce: Enter the first room and turn the corner. The next area no longer turns on when entering the trigger collider.",
